# Advanced EDA Automation — Industrial-Ready Upgrade

## Project Structure

```
EDA automation/
├── app.py                  # Main Streamlit entry point (thin orchestrator)
├── .env                    # API keys
├── requirements.txt        # All dependencies pinned
├── config/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   └── settings.py         # Constants, model configs, timeouts, system prompts
├── core/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── llm.py              # Ollama + NVIDIA API communication
│   ├── context.py          # Build rich data context for LLM
│   └── agentic.py          # Plan → Execute → Synthesize pipeline
├── analysis/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── features.py         # Date/interaction/imputation feature engineering
│   ├── stats.py            # Normality, chi-square, PCA, clustering
│   ├── anomaly.py          # NEW: Isolation Forest, Z-score, IQR
│   └── ml.py               # NEW: Quick ML (RF, LR, XGBoost)
├── tools/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── code_sandbox.py     # NEW: Safe LLM code execution
│   ├── nl_viz.py           # NEW: Natural language → chart
│   └── report.py           # NEW: HTML report export
└── ui/
    ├── __init__.py
    ├── styles.py           # CSS styling
    ├── sidebar.py          # Sidebar components
    └── sections.py         # All UI sections (data, stats, viz, chat, etc.)
```

## Execution Order

1. requirements.txt
2. config/settings.py
3. core/llm.py, core/context.py, core/agentic.py
4. analysis/features.py, analysis/stats.py
5. analysis/anomaly.py (NEW), analysis/ml.py (NEW)
6. tools/code_sandbox.py (NEW), tools/nl_viz.py (NEW), tools/report.py (NEW)
7. ui/styles.py, ui/sidebar.py, ui/sections.py
8. app.py (thin orchestrator)
9. Verify & test
